config MAGIC_WAND_INFERENCE_STRIDE
	int "Samples between inferences"
	default 1
	range 1 10
	help
	  Run inference at most every this many accelerometer samples, once
	  the 128-sample window is full. 1 matches upstream: an inference per
	  sample, at 25 Hz. Sampling runs in its own thread, so an inference
	  slower than a sample period (40 ms) only makes inference run less
	  often; raise this to spend less CPU on it.

source "Kconfig.zephyr"
